@inject Microsoft.Extensions.Options.IOptions<StoreOptions> Options
@{
    var store = Options.Value;
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of service";
}

<p>These terms apply when you use this website or buy from @store.LegalName ("we", "us"). By placing an order, you agree to them.</p>

<h2>Who can buy</h2>
<p>You must be at least 18 years old and have a shipping address in a state we deliver to.</p>

<h2>Our products and your health</h2>
<p>
    Our products are dietary supplements. They are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease, and
    the information on this website is not medical advice. These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug
    Administration. Talk to your doctor before starting any supplement, especially if you are pregnant or nursing, take
    medication, or have a medical condition. Follow the directions and warnings on each product's label.
</p>

<h2>Orders and prices</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Prices are in US dollars and shown at checkout before you pay, along with any shipping charge.</li>
    <li>
        Your order is accepted when we confirm it by email. If a product becomes unavailable or a price is shown in error,
        we may cancel the order and refund you in full.
    </li>
    <li>Payments are processed by PayPal and are subject to PayPal's terms.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Shipping, refunds and subscriptions</h2>
<p>
    Delivery, our money-back guarantee and refunds are covered in <a asp-action="ShippingAndRefunds">Shipping &amp; refunds</a>.
    Automatic renewals are covered in our <a asp-action="SubscriptionTerms">subscription terms</a>.
</p>

<h2>Your account</h2>
<p>
    You sign in with a one-time link sent to your email address, so keep access to your email secure. You're responsible
    for activity in your account.
</p>

<h2>Acceptable use</h2>
<p>Don't misuse the website, for example by trying to disrupt it, access other customers' information, or place fraudulent orders.</p>

<h2>Our content</h2>
<p>The website's text, images and branding belong to us or our licensors and may not be copied without permission.</p>

<h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
<p>
    To the extent the law allows, our total liability for any claim relating to an order is limited to the amount you
    paid for it, and we're not liable for indirect or consequential losses. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have
    under consumer protection law.
</p>

<h2>Governing law</h2>
<p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of @store.LegalState and applicable US federal law.</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We may update these terms. The version in effect when you place an order applies to that order.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>@store.LegalName · @store.ContactEmail</p>
